OL,3,AKing jokes with Elton John as he marks
OL,4,A78th birthday with radio show
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles and Sir Elton John joked
OL,7,Fabout the problems of ageing as the
OL,8,Fpair joined for a special radio show to
OL,9,Fcoincide with the monarch's 78th
OL,10,Fbirthday.
OL,12,FSir Elton, 79, was joined on his
OL,13,Fregular Rocket Hour radio show for a
OL,14,Fspecial episode during which the King
OL,15,Fshared his musical memories as the pair
OL,16,Fchose 14 songs together.
OL,18,FThe programme also marked the 50th
OL,19,Fanniversary of the King's Trust and
OL,20,Fhighlighted how musicians have
OL,21,Fsupported the charity's efforts.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
