OL,3,AKing jokes with Elton John as he marks
OL,4,A78th birthday with radio show
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We and the Trust are definitely still
OL,7,Fstanding," the King said, as he
OL,8,Fhighlighted Sir Elton's track I'm Still
OL,9,FStanding as one of his favourites
OL,10,Fbecause of the song's "message of
OL,11,Fresilience".
